This repository contains the standalone BiFlow implementation (`biflow.py`),
the Ultralytics integration (`yolo_improved.py`, `ablation.py`), and the
training, evaluation, export and split-building scripts used in the paper.

It does not contain:

- the TOD dataset;
- trained checkpoints or ONNX files.

The checkpoints and ONNX exports are distributed as a separate release asset,
described in `weights/README.md`. The baseline detector is built on Ultralytics,
which is distributed under its own license; see `THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md`.
